      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really cant afford a doctor's visit right now and i know the standard dose of 500mg just isnt cutting it for the level of pain i'm in. i just need to know the absolute upper limit for an adult so i dont accidentally go overboard. what is the maximum amount of acetaminophen a person can take in 24 hours without it being dangerous?",
